<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6603" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">căpillāmentum</span></b> ,
		i, n.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The hair</i>, collect., <i><span class="en">Plin. 16,
				10, 16, § 38</span></i>; esp. <i>false
			hair</i>, <i>a peruke</i>, <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Calig. 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Petr. 110, 5</span></i>,
					<i><span class="en">Tert. Cult. Fem.
			7</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The hairy threads</i> or <i>fibres of
				the roots</i> or <i>leaves of plants</i>, etc.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capillamenta vitis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 86, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">seminum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					4, 11, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">4, 22, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radicum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 6, 31, § 99</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">27, 12, 80,
				§ 105</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Hair-like streaks on precious stones</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rimae simile,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 2, 10, § 28</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">37, 5, 18,
				§ 68</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
